<article class="container legal"><h1 class="serif">Privacy and analytics</h1><p>Reviewed 2026-10-30. This independent, unofficial, nonprofit tourism and educational guide has no accounts, comments, ticket sales or contact form.</p><h2>Google Analytics loads automatically</h2><p>Pages automatically load Google Analytics 4, without waiting for a site consent switch. Google may receive page URLs, referrers, browsing events, browser and device information and use cookies or other identifiers. We do not promise complete anonymity. This site has no analytics consent or disable control. Browser settings or Google’s opt-out tool may restrict some collection; this site does not guarantee their effect.</p><p><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google privacy policy</a> · <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out tool</a></p><h2>Cloudflare hosting and independent visit measurement</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts the site and processes connection, IP and request information for delivery, security and performance. Production HTML samples on 2026-10-30 differed: one round of responses for all 26 normal pages from Cloudflare’s SLC edge contained an Insights beacon marker, while a separate LAX homepage response did not. This is an observation of those HTML samples, not proof that every visitor receives the same content, that the script executed or that data was transmitted. Later settings and responses may change. The hosting provider may independently provide Web Analytics visit measurement involving page views, URLs, referrers, browser, device and performance data. Even a tag’s presence would not alone prove execution or successful transmission. This measurement is distinct from edge connection and security processing and is not governed by a nonexistent site GA switch.</p><p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics data and metrics</a> · <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a></p><h2>External links, images and browser data</h2><p>Images are served by this site without directly contacting Commons to display them. Maps and official sources open as external links under their respective policies. This site does not request your location. The former offline worker is retired and the site’s known pingtungpark-v1 cache removed to avoid serving an outdated offline homepage. This does not erase Google or other third-party cookies.</p><h2>Use of the guide</h2><p>Dated information is not a live operator notice. Recheck weather, transport and actual conditions. A photographic licence does not independently clear all depicted subject rights. Use the relevant service provider’s official channel for individual data-rights assistance; no fictional support address is supplied here.</p></article>
